sequenceDiagram
    actor Doctor
    participant MVC as GummySmileController
    participant Svc as GummySmileCaseService
    participant API as GummySmileApiService
    participant Cloud as Gummy Smile API
    participant DB as SQL Server

    Doctor->>MVC: Start analysis for patient
    MVC->>Svc: StartCaseAsync(patientId)
    Svc->>API: CreateCaseAsync()
    API->>Cloud: POST api/cases
    Cloud-->>API: GsCaseDto
    API-->>Svc: case id
    Svc->>DB: Insert GummySmileCase
    Svc-->>MVC: localCaseId
    MVC-->>Doctor: Redirect to Upload

    Doctor->>MVC: Upload rest and smile images
    MVC->>Svc: UploadImagesAsync()
    Svc->>API: UploadImageAsync(rest)
    API->>Cloud: POST api/cases/id/images
    Svc->>API: UploadImageAsync(smile)
    API->>Cloud: POST api/cases/id/images
    Svc->>DB: Save image bytes
    MVC-->>Doctor: Redirect to Analyze

    Doctor->>MVC: Run analysis
    MVC->>Svc: RunAnalysisAsync()
    Svc->>API: AnalyzeAsync()
    API->>Cloud: POST api/cases/id/analyze
    Cloud-->>API: AI results
    Svc->>DB: Update case snapshot JSON
    MVC-->>Doctor: Show Review page

    Doctor->>MVC: Submit clinical data and overrides
    MVC->>Svc: Save clinical and overrides
    Svc->>API: UpdateClinical / UpdateOverrides
    Svc->>DB: Persist clinical JSON
    MVC-->>Doctor: Diagnosis and Treatment views

    Doctor->>MVC: Download PDF report
    MVC->>Svc: GetReportPdfAsync()
    Svc->>API: GET api/cases/id/report.pdf
    API->>Cloud: Fetch PDF
    Cloud-->>Doctor: PDF file download
